# 约定(2026-09-23 重写, 对齐 api/address/v1 的 proto):
#   直连 = http://{host}:{port}, 身份由 x-md-global-user-id 头模拟网关注入;
#   网关 = {gateway_scheme}://{gateway_host}(LAN) 或 https://{public_gateway_host}(公网), 带 Authorization: Bearer {token}。
#   变量在 http-client.env.json(dev)。host 用 [::1]: 127.0.0.1:30001/30002/30003 被 GoLand/WebStorm/JCEF 占着。

### healthz
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/healthz
Content-Type: application/json

### ListRegions 省级(需要 addresses.regions 字典: psql -f internal/data/seed/seed_regions.sql, 2026-09-23 已灌 3438 行)
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/address.v1.RegionService/ListRegions
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### ListRegions 北京下级
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/address.v1.RegionService/ListRegions
Content-Type: application/json

{"parentId": 1}

### ListAddresses(seed 用户 2 条)
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/address.v1.AddressService/ListAddresses
Content-Type: application/json
x-md-global-user-id: {{user_id}}

{}

### GetAddress
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/address.v1.AddressService/GetAddress
Content-Type: application/json
x-md-global-user-id: {{user_id}}

{"addressId": "{{address_id}}"}

### CreateAddress(写 dev 库)
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/address.v1.AddressService/CreateAddress
Content-Type: application/json
x-md-global-user-id: {{user_id}}

{
  "recipientName": "测试收件人",
  "recipientPhone": "13800000000",
  "detail": {"province": "北京市", "city": "北京市", "district": "朝阳区", "detail": "http-client 测试地址 1 号", "postalCode": "100000"},
  "isDefault": false
}

### UpdateAddress
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/address.v1.AddressService/UpdateAddress
Content-Type: application/json
x-md-global-user-id: {{user_id}}

{"addressId": "{{address_id}}", "recipientName": "测试收件人-改", "recipientPhone": "13800000000", "detail": {"province": "北京市", "city": "北京市", "district": "朝阳区", "detail": "http-client 测试地址 1 号", "postalCode": "100000"}}

### SetDefaultAddress
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/address.v1.AddressService/SetDefaultAddress
Content-Type: application/json
x-md-global-user-id: {{user_id}}

{"addressId": "{{address_id}}"}

### DeleteAddress(删 seed 第二条; 软删)
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/address.v1.AddressService/DeleteAddress
Content-Type: application/json
x-md-global-user-id: {{user_id}}

{"addressId": "5eeda1a0-0000-4000-8000-000000000002"}

### ListAddresses(LAN 网关)
POST {{gateway_scheme}}://{{gateway_host}}/address.v1.AddressService/ListAddresses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{}
